# Extended GRN Column Support

Add 6 new fields (Pack, MRP/Tab, Rate/Tab, Discount%, Tax₹, Barcode) to the full pipeline:
OCR schema → parser normalization → Excel export → frontend table.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend — Schema & Extraction

#### [MODIFY] [chandra_extract.py](file:///d:/BillBotAI/backend/services/chandra_extract.py)
- Expand `EXTRACT_SCHEMA` properties to include `pack`, `mrp_per_tab`, `rate_per_tab`, `discount_percent`, `tax_amount`, `barcode`
- Update the LLM description for each new field with OCR alias hints

#### [MODIFY] [parser_service.py](file:///d:/BillBotAI/backend/services/parser_service.py)
- Extend `ALLOWED_FIELDS` list with the 6 new field names
- Add `COLUMN_ALIASES` dict for noisy OCR header normalization
- Add `parse_number(value)` helper that strips `₹`, `%`, commas, and returns `float | None`
- Apply `parse_number` in `clean_line_item()` for all numeric fields

